{smcl}
{* version 1.0.0  10jul2026  Hans Gerhardt}{...}
{hi:isco08_to_oepde()} {hline 2} Translate 4-digit ISCO-08 to OEP scores for Germany

{title:Syntax}

        {cmd:isco08_to_oepde(}{varname}{cmd:)}

{pstd}
    where {it:varname} contains 4-digit ISCO-08 codes.

{title:Description}

{pstd}
    {helpb crosswalk} table translating 4-digit ISCO-08 codes to OEP scores for Germany
    (Occupational Earning Potential; Oesch et al. 2025).

{title:Source}

{pstd}
    Columns {bf:isco08_4} and {bf:oep_de4} in file
    {bf:isco08-4_to_oep.xlsx} provided by Oesch (2025).

{title:References}

{phang}
    Oesch, D., Lipps, O., Shahbazian, R., Bihagen, E., & Morris, K. (2026). Occupational earning potential: a new measure of social hierarchy in Europe and the US. European Sociological Review, 42(3), 421–441.
    DOI: {browse "https://doi.org/10.1093/esr/jcaf035":10.1093/esr/jcaf035}.
    {p_end}
{phang}
    Oesch, Daniel, Oliver Lipps, Roujman Shahbazian, Erik Bihagen,
    Katy Morris. 2025. Occupational Earning Potential (OEP) Scale
    (2025-03-11 update). OSF,
    DOI:{browse "https://doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/PR89U":10.17605/OSF.IO/PR89U}. 
    {p_end}
